From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hjviewer <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 04:49:38 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 124/162] hjviewer: the PC's remote readiness card and G4
 (TV-W4)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

TV-W4 (design w3-w4 3-4, 3-5, 5-5, 5-6; architecture.md 5-12): Settings -> Account of a Windows PC
that takes connections gets a "원격 준비" card below this PC's line. Its rows, with a mark
(done, advised, needed, not checked) and [고치기] or [방법 보기]:
- taking connections: installed and the service starting with Windows and running; logged in for
  the gate (U06's cause and button on a refused PC, a P2/P3 ticket is a warning); the permanent
  password with the password method and the approval mode (click only is a needed row even with a
  password); sleep on mains power, a warning only where a relay on its network wakes the PC (D14),
  with lid and battery lines;
- switching it on (logged-in PCs): the wired card's wake as the PC's own wake report has it, fast
  startup, the relay from hjv-api's GET /api/hjv/devices/<this PC>/wol;
- when a session ends: idle disconnect ([켜기 (30분)]) and W3's end lock.
A PC without the install shows the install row only (D17); the card then also takes the PC
password's row out of this PC's lines (D18). The needed rows of the first group are the header's
count.

D-11: fast startup, the network card and the relay get [방법 보기] only, short steps from
docs/wol-pc-setup.md with [자세히] for its section. The only setting HJViewer changes is the
current power plan's plugged-in sleep and hibernate times, when the user presses [절전 안 함]
after a confirm, as the Windows user (no new service path); the old values stay in that user's
LocalConfig for [되돌리기], on the same plan only. A policy key keeps the button away. The
password, method, approval and idle options go behind the security settings' unlock
(hjvUnlockThen, taken out of _setPcPassword).

D-12: G4 on the PC home ("원격 준비: n가지가 남았습니다 [점검]") of a logged-in installed Windows PC
while an essential row (install and start, password and approval, sleep) is left, after P1, P2/P3
and G2; G2 gets the text button [원격 준비 점검]. Both open the card. The home counts once a minute
from hjv-ready-home (no network cards) and asks hjv-api only when sleeping would count.

Core: src/hjviewer_ready.rs behind hjviewer_account's main_get_common/main_set_common dispatch
(hjv-ready, hjv-ready-home, hjv-ready-fix); no bridge change. Windows reads and writes through
powrprof (PowerGetActiveScheme, PowerRead/WriteACValueIndex, PowerSetActiveScheme), the policy
and service keys through winreg; elsewhere {"v":1,"windows":false}. hjviewer_wol's Report gets
local_summary() (card names, armed, magic, USB; no MAC or address).

Tests: src/hjviewer_ready/tests.rs, hjviewer_wol's local_summary test, and the new pure
flutter/test/hjviewer_ready_test.dart (rows, header and G4 counts, texts).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
